  "description": "An in-process local language model for TechieRag: UseLocalLlm() gives an ILlmProvider that runs a small open-weight model inside the app (a small model on Android and iOS, a larger one on desktops). The weights download once, after the host accepts the model's terms, into the per-user application data folder, SHA-256 verified and resumable; after that the model works offline. Memory is checked before loading, over-long prompts are refused before inference, and typed streaming, JSON output and the model's real tokenizer are supported.",
